<NPR>NOTE:  For unit-price contracts, include first bracketed statements and delete 
the second set.  <BRK/>
<BRK/>
For lump sum contracts, delete the first bracketed statements and include the 
second set.</NPR><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
<BRK/>
<TXT>[Quantities of<TAI OPT="HOT-MIX"> hot-mix</TAI><TAI OPT="WARM-MIX"> warm-mix</TAI> asphalt pavement, determined as specified above, will be paid for at respective 
contract unit prices.  Payment will constitute full compensation for furnishing all materials, equipment, plant, 
and tools; and for all labor and other incidentals necessary to complete work required by this section of the 
specification.][The measured quantity of<TAI OPT="HOT-MIX"> hot-mixed</TAI><TAI OPT="WARM-MIX"> warm-mixed</TAI> asphalt pavement will be paid for and included 
in the lump sum contract price.]</TXT><BRK/>
